    "description": "Organo Corporation operates as a water treatment engineering company in Japan, Taiwan, the United States, China, Southeast Asia, and internationally. The company engages in the manufacturing, sales, and maintenance of various water and wastewater treatment systems utilizing ion exchange resins, separation membranes, activated carbon, etc.; provision of water treatment outsourcing services; and sales of various water treatment chemicals and food processing materials. Its products include filtration equipment: soft water systems; pure and ultrapure water systems; tabletop pure and ultrapure water systems; filters; water treatment facilities; water treatment chemicals; ion-exchange resin and replenishment material; and other technologies and services. The company also provides remote monitoring; maintenance planning, scheduled inspections, and supplying of consumables; equipment diagnostics, equipment enhancement, and modification work; and equipment-owned service model services. It provides its products and services to electronics; pharmaceutical and cosmetics; chemicals and machinery; food and beverages; thermal and nuclear power plant; water and sewage treatment plants; healthcare and research institutions; convenience stores and restaurants; and buildings and commercial facilities. The company was formerly known as Japan Organo Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Organo Corporation in 1966. Organo Corporation was incorporated in 1941 and is headquartered in Koto, Japan."
